---
title: Matcha Latte
image: https://starbuckmenu.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Matcha-green-tea-latte-Starbucks-price.webp
time required: 2 minutes
servings: 1
---

Sift @matcha{2%tsp} into a cup. 

Add @hot water{2%oz}(160-175°F) and whisk vigorously until frothy and matcha has dissolved. 

Mix in @?sugar{1%tsp} and @?vanilla extract{1%tsp}.

Steam @milk{8%oz} and pour into the matcha, rocking the cup to stir in the milk gently.

Top with additional @?matcha if desired.

> You can replace the sugar and vanilla extract with 1 Torani pump equivalent of the syrup of your choice, i.e. toasted marshmallow. 